function lpdmV2Escape(t){return String(t).replace(/&/g,"&amp;").replace(/</g,"&lt;").replace(/>/g,"&gt;").replace(/"/g,"&quot;");}
function lpdmV2Path(g,i){return "/"+g[0]+(i?"/"+i[0]:"");}

const memorialPeople=[{name:"양홍관",aliases:["금송","금송 양홍관"],dates:"1959–2026",label:"생명 · 평화 · 협동 · 자치",href:"/memorial/yang-honggwan"}];
function memorialDirectory(){
 const chars=["전체","ㄱ","ㄴ","ㄷ","ㄹ","ㅁ","ㅂ","ㅅ","ㅇ","ㅈ","ㅊ","ㅋ","ㅌ","ㅍ","ㅎ"];
 return '<section class="section memorial-directory"><div class="wrap"><h2>추모관 둘러보기</h2><p class="lead">고인의 성명으로 찾고, ㄱ~ㅎ 초성으로 분류합니다. 호·별칭도 검색할 수 있습니다.</p><div class="search-panel"><label for="memorial-search">고인 이름 검색</label><input id="memorial-search" type="search" placeholder="예: 양홍관" autocomplete="off"><div class="initial-picker" role="group" aria-label="한글 초성 선택">'+chars.map((c,i)=>'<button type="button" class="initial-option'+(i===0?' selected':'')+'" data-initial="'+c+'" aria-pressed="'+(i===0?'true':'false')+'">'+c+'</button>').join("")+'</div></div><p class="results-label" id="memorial-results" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="memorial-results">'+memorialPeople.map(p=>'<a class="memorial-person" data-name="'+lpdmV2Escape(p.name)+'" data-aliases="'+lpdmV2Escape(p.aliases.join(" "))+'" href="'+p.href+'"><div class="memorial-cover" aria-hidden="true">松</div><div class="memorial-info"><small>LPDM 제1호 추모관</small><h3>'+lpdmV2Escape(p.name)+'</h3><p>'+p.dates+' · '+lpdmV2Escape(p.label)+'</p><strong>추모관 입장 →</strong></div></a>').join("")+'</div><p id="memorial-empty" class="notice" hidden>조건에 맞는 추모관이 없습니다.</p></div></section>';
}
const memorialSearchJs='<script>(()=>{const input=document.getElementById("memorial-search");if(!input)return;const bs=[...document.querySelectorAll(".initial-option")],cs=[...document.querySelectorAll(".memorial-person")],count=document.getElementById("memorial-results"),empty=document.getElementById("memorial-empty");let active="전체";const table=["ㄱ","ㄲ","ㄴ","ㄷ","ㄸ","ㄹ","ㅁ","ㅂ","ㅃ","ㅅ","ㅆ","ㅇ","ㅈ","ㅉ","ㅊ","ㅋ","ㅌ","ㅍ","ㅎ"];function initial(s){const c=s.charCodeAt(0);if(c<44032||c>55203)return "기타";return table[Math.floor((c-44032)/588)].replace("ㄲ","ㄱ").replace("ㄸ","ㄷ").replace("ㅃ","ㅂ").replace("ㅆ","ㅅ").replace("ㅉ","ㅈ")}function update(){const q=input.value.trim().toLocaleLowerCase("ko");let total=0;cs.forEach(card=>{const name=card.dataset.name||"";const aliases=card.dataset.aliases||"";const pass=(active==="전체"||initial(name)===active)&&(!q||(name+" "+aliases).toLocaleLowerCase("ko").includes(q));card.hidden=!pass;if(pass)total++});count.textContent="검색 결과 "+total+"곳";empty.hidden=total!==0}bs.forEach(b=>b.addEventListener("click",()=>{active=b.dataset.initial;bs.forEach(x=>{x.classList.toggle("selected",x===b);x.setAttribute("aria-pressed",String(x===b))});update()}));input.addEventListener("input",update);update()})();</script>';

const lpdmMenuHoverScript='<script>(()=>{const menus=[...document.querySelectorAll(".navigation .menu")];const touch=()=>matchMedia("(hover:none), (pointer:coarse)").matches;menus.forEach(menu=>{const trigger=menu.querySelector(":scope > a");const dropdown=menu.querySelector(".drop");if(!trigger||!dropdown)return;let timer;const open=()=>{clearTimeout(timer);menu.classList.add("is-open")};const closeSoon=()=>{clearTimeout(timer);timer=setTimeout(()=>menu.classList.remove("is-open"),550)};menu.addEventListener("pointerenter",e=>{if(e.pointerType!=="touch")open()});menu.addEventListener("pointerleave",e=>{if(e.pointerType!=="touch")closeSoon()});menu.addEventListener("focusin",open);menu.addEventListener("focusout",e=>{if(!menu.contains(e.relatedTarget))closeSoon()});trigger.addEventListener("click",e=>{if(!touch())return;if(!menu.classList.contains("is-open")){e.preventDefault();menus.forEach(m=>m.classList.remove("is-open"));open()}});dropdown.querySelectorAll("a").forEach(a=>a.addEventListener("click",()=>{clearTimeout(timer);menu.classList.remove("is-open")}))});document.addEventListener("keydown",e=>{if(e.key==="Escape")menus.forEach(m=>m.classList.remove("is-open"))});document.addEventListener("pointerdown",e=>{if(!menus.some(m=>m.contains(e.target)))menus.forEach(m=>m.classList.remove("is-open"))})})();</script>';
